@everyone VELO — The next key support is around $10. However, if the price drops to $10 and fails to hold that level, we could see a deeper retracement, potentially below $7.

I expect the stock to become oversold on the daily chart before we see a meaningful upward move. It is currently approaching deeply oversold territory on the daily timeframe, so I’ll be watching closely for signs of stabilization and a potential reversal.
